    "body": "When I run your top example in Firefox, I get the following, which I believe is the requested behavior?\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"a\": {\r\n    \"b\": {\r\n      \"c\": {\r\n        \"d\": {\r\n          \"e\": {\r\n            \"f\": {\r\n              \"g\": {\r\n                \"foo\": \"bar\",\r\n                \"array\": [\r\n                  1,\r\n                  2,\r\n                  3,\r\n                  4,\r\n                  5\r\n                ]\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI would expect `dir` to be the same as what you're asking for with `json`.",
