    "body": "> I was told by that team to come here, so thats why I'm here lol.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately I don't think there is too much here that's actionable since as Terin mentioned, this is very much implementation-specific territory. That is, if we were to spec `console.json`, it would be subject to the same implementation-specific liberties that the spec gives for other APIs. Given that I don't see much of a path forward, I might recommend closing this issue.",
