    "body": "I think this would be better resolved by working with your user-agent to provide the options you want to for `console.dir`,  rather than requiring one specific encoding. I have concerns around serialization and transmission requirements needed in remote debugging scenarios, and `console.dir` allows agents to use other structures more suitable for their environments (eg, Nyxt might use lists or cons).",
